is K(R) because the generic fibre of R=p²V is irreducible (cubic in g over
K(p) with a non-cube constant term). Multiplying by R, each order m in
(2j,3j] gives (F²)_m − (F³)_m/(9R³) ∈ R·K[g,p]+K[R], where (F³)_m is 0
