Ten capped normal/−O runs pass with identical rational-string witness bytes and zero Assert nodes. Each negative control changes an actual object or term: deletes the intermediate D, changes the sixth coefficient, omits αG, or perturbs the nonconstant unit. The same equality verifiers reject them. No predicate-only face/weight flip is used in this packet.

